                                    <h1>ITD GrowthLabs Skincare Pricing Tiers &amp;mdash; Full Transparency (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#db2777;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD SKINCARE + BEAUTY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live skincare + beauty vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for skincare brands</a> with 4+ published D2C beauty brand case studies including <a href="/resources/Kama_Ayurveda_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Kama Ayurveda</a>, <a href="/resources/Plum_Beauty_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Plum Beauty</a>, <a href="/resources/Sugar_Cosmetics_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Sugar Cosmetics</a>, and <a href="/resources/WOW_Skin_Science_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">WOW Skin Science</a>. Plus <a href="/resources/How_Nykaa_Built_India_Largest_Beauty_Brand_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Nykaa growth story</a>, <a href="/resources/Ayurveda_Traditional_Wellness_D2C_India_Global_2026.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Ayurveda D2C playbook</a>, seasonal <a href="/resources/Summer_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Summer</a> + <a href="/resources/Winter_Skincare_Wellness_Playbook_D2C_2026_2027.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Winter Skincare</a> playbooks, and 11 GCC city-specific beauty pages (<a href="/services/gcc/dubai-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/riyadh-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Riyadh</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-beauty-cosmetics-agency.php" style="color:#db2777;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, Abu Dhabi, Dammam, Al Khobar, Kuwait City, Manama, Muscat, Ras al Khaimah). Every framework below is grounded in live category work.</div><p>Transparent pricing = professionalism baseline. This is ITD's skincare pricing structure. Three tiers matched to revenue stage. Ad spend transparent pass-through (no markup). No lock-in beyond 6-month MSA with cancellation after month 3 if milestones missed.</p>
                                    <h2>Starter tier &amp;mdash; Rs 65,000 / month</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Rs 15L-1.5 Cr / year revenue brands.</p><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>1 paid channel management (Meta OR Google) + Rs 40K-1L/mo ad spend (separate)</li><li>SEO foundation + 2-3 pieces / month content</li><li>Instagram organic + management (12-16 posts / month)</li><li>WhatsApp basic + retention (up to 3 flows)</li><li>Shopify + attribution monitoring (basic)</li><li>Monthly QBR + performance report</li><li>Founder + senior strategist on QBR (quarterly)</li><li>Weekly Slack + email working communication</li><li>2 people dedicated pod</li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables per month:</strong> 12-16 Instagram posts + 4-8 Reels + 2-3 blog pieces + basic email + WhatsApp flow + weekly performance monitoring.</p>
                                    <h2>Growth tier &amp;mdash; Rs 1,80,000 / month</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Rs 1.5-20 Cr / year revenue brands.</p><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Full paid stack (Meta + Google + YouTube + Snapchat if GCC + Pinterest) + Rs 2-8L/mo ad spend (separate)</li><li>SEO 6-10 pieces / month + silo build (5-8 silo pages / month)</li><li>Instagram + YouTube + Pinterest organic + management (30-45 posts / month)</li><li>WhatsApp Cloud API + full retention + skin quiz flows</li><li>Subscription + refill programme optimisation</li><li>Derm + creator programme (4-8 creators / month)</li><li>Photography + video production (30-60 SKUs / quarter)</li><li>Weekly + monthly + quarterly reporting</li><li>Founder + senior strategist monthly + weekly working sessions</li><li>4-6 people dedicated pod</li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables per month:</strong> 30-45 Instagram + 12-20 Reels + 4-6 YouTube + 6-10 blog pieces + 5-8 silo pages + full email + WhatsApp + derm + creator campaigns + weekly performance monitoring.</p>
                                    <h2>Enterprise tier &amp;mdash; Rs 4,50,000+ / month</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Rs 20 Cr+ / year revenue brands.</p><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Full-stack multi-channel + multi-region (India + GCC + international) + Rs 8-40L/mo ad spend (separate)</li><li>SEO 10-20 pieces / month + full silo build + 100-200 content library / year + AI Overviews optimisation</li><li>Instagram + YouTube + Pinterest + Snapchat + LinkedIn organic + management (60-100 posts / month)</li><li>WhatsApp Cloud API + advanced retention + skin quiz + subscription programmes</li><li>Advanced subscription + refill + winback + loyalty + concern-cross-sell</li><li>Derm + celebrity + creator programme (10-25 partnerships / month)</li><li>PR + editorial + luxury + heritage-publication placements</li><li>Photography + video production (100-300 SKUs / quarter)</li><li>Arabic + Hindi + regional-language creative</li><li>Weekly + monthly + quarterly + investor-grade reporting</li><li>Founder + senior + CMO / head-of-growth partnership</li><li>5-10 people dedicated pod</li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables per month:</strong> 60-100 organic posts + 25-40 Reels + 10-20 YouTube + 10-20 blogs + 20-40 silo pages + full multi-region campaigns + 10-25 creator + celebrity + PR partnerships + regional-language creative + weekly performance monitoring.</p>
                                    <h2>Ad spend &amp;mdash; transparent pass-through</h2>
                                    <p>Ad spend NOT included in retainer. Transparent pass-through model:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Client pays platforms directly via own billing (Meta / Google / Snapchat / Pinterest / LinkedIn / YouTube)</li><li>OR ITD bills exactly what was spent (no markup) + monthly invoice with platform receipts attached</li><li>NO 15-30% markup that generic agencies bundle</li><li>NO minimum ad spend commitment</li><li>Ad spend scales with performance (see benchmarks in <a href="/resources/skincare_google_meta_cpl_benchmarks_india_gcc.php">CPL benchmarks piece</a>)</li></ul><p>Transparent pass-through = professionalism baseline. Bundled + markup-inclusive agencies hide 15-30% margin. Avoid.</p>
                                    <h2>Contract + engagement structure</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>6-month MSA (Master Service Agreement)</li><li>Cancellation after month 3 if milestones missed (30-day notice)</li><li>Monthly invoicing (net-15)</li><li>Phased payment for one-time (30% signing + 20% brand + 25% Shopify + 25% launch)</li><li>Documented playbooks + attribution + creative library owned by client</li><li>IP + brand assets 100% client-owned</li><li>Weekly Slack + email + working sessions + quarterly in-person QBR</li><li>Founder + senior access baseline (not gated)</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Common pricing myths</h2>
                                    <ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>"Cheaper agency = better value" &mdash; No. Below Rs 65K/month = insufficient depth + generic templates + junior-only team. Skincare requires category fluency + compliance + attribution + creative velocity that costs meaningful money to deliver.</li><li>"Bundled ad-spend + retainer simpler" &mdash; No. Hides 15-30% margin. Transparent pass-through = ~20-40% total cost savings over 24 months.</li><li>"Guaranteed ROAS" &mdash; No. Legitimate agencies do NOT guarantee ROAS. Ad platforms + market dynamics + brand + creative + funnel determine ROAS. Agency claims of "guaranteed 8x ROAS" = red flag.</li><li>"Long lock-in = commitment" &mdash; No. 12+ month lock-in = agency protecting itself. 6-month MSA + cancellation-after-3 = fair for both sides.</li></ul>

