                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What are ITD's skincare pricing tiers?</h3>
                                        <p>Starter Rs 65K/month (Rs 15L-1.5 Cr revenue), Growth Rs 1.8L/month (Rs 1.5-20 Cr), Enterprise Rs 4.5L+/month (Rs 20 Cr+). All tiers exclude ad spend (transparent pass-through, no markup).</p>
                                        <h3>Is ad spend included in retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>No. Ad spend transparent pass-through. Client pays platforms directly OR ITD bills exactly what was spent + platform receipts. No 15-30% markup. Bundled + markup-inclusive agencies hide margin. Avoid.</p>
