                                        <h3>What does Growth tier include for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Full paid stack (Meta + Google + YouTube + Snapchat if GCC + Pinterest) + SEO 6-10 pieces + silo build + Instagram + YouTube + Pinterest (30-45 posts) + WhatsApp Cloud API + subscription optimisation + derm + creator programme (4-8/month) + photography + weekly reporting + 4-6-person pod.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Enterprise tier include for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Full-stack multi-channel + multi-region (India + GCC + international) + SEO 10-20 pieces + full silo + 100-200 content library/year + AI Overviews + Instagram + YouTube + Pinterest + Snapchat + LinkedIn (60-100 posts) + advanced subscription + derm + celebrity + creator (10-25 partnerships) + PR + Arabic + Hindi creative + investor-grade reporting + 5-10-person pod.</p>
                                        <h3>What is contract structure?</h3>
                                        <p>6-month MSA + cancellation after month 3 if milestones missed (30-day notice) + monthly net-15 invoicing + phased payment for one-time + documented playbooks + IP + brand 100% client-owned + weekly working sessions + quarterly in-person QBR + founder + senior access baseline.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we upgrade or downgrade tier mid-contract?</h3>
